{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pawsta</i></strong><i> is a <strong>cozy</strong> cooking game with cute <strong>claymation</strong>-style graphics. It stars <strong>Rigatoni</strong>, the mouse\ud83d\udc2d, as he travels the world <strong>mastering</strong> cuisines &amp; collecting <strong>mice-alin stars</strong>!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make your <strong>Nonna </strong>proud by helping out your <strong>relatives </strong>at their <strong>international </strong>restaurants</i> \u2728 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook from Scratch!\ud83c\udf45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>to cook new cuisines<strong> from scratch</strong> by building them up <strong>step-by-step</strong>. <strong>Chop</strong> veggies, <strong>roll</strong> out dough, and <strong>sprinkle</strong> in fresh herbs until the food is<strong> just right</strong>!\u00a0\ud83e\udd0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta dough gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Cute Animal Guests!\ud83d\ude38</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from a <strong>cute roster </strong>of <strong>animal </strong>patrons. Try to follow their orders as best as you can by choosing the correct food ingredients. Lots of\u00a0<strong>happy customers\u00a0</strong>can lead to great things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta kitty order gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Around the World!\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rigatoni has family all around the <strong>globe</strong>! Team up with your <strong>pilot</strong> friend,\u00a0<strong>Balto,\u00a0</strong>to travel the <strong>world </strong>and help out at their restaurants. It's <strong>your call </strong>where to go next, be it <strong>Brazil </strong>or <strong>Japan</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta plane flying gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master new cuisines!\u00a0\ud83c\udf63</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> and <strong>master</strong> new <strong>cuisines</strong> from the <strong>countries</strong> you visit, including <strong>sushi</strong> in Japan! <strong>Impress</strong> enough guests &amp; you'll also gain access to special\u00a0<strong>mice-alin</strong> dishes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta sushi cutting gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meep!\ud83d\udc2d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let loose a bit by <strong>&quot;meeping&quot;</strong> to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/7d4170d005d72d3b4c4b40d4eac70e3b.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta Rigatoni meep gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/7d4170d005d72d3b4c4b40d4eac70e3b.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/7d4170d005d72d3b4c4b40d4eac70e3b.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to come\u00a0\ud83d\ude0b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise </strong>your look!\ud83e\udde2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a delightful family-driven story\u00a0\ud83d\udc9e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun cooking minigames!\u00a0\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade  the <strong>cosmetics </strong>of your restaurants &amp; kitchenware \ud83c\udfa8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock </strong>new <strong>playable </strong>chefs\u00a0\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare <strong>Legendary Mice-alin</strong> dishes\u00a0\ud83c\udf71</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow cozy <strong>day-to-night</strong> service cycles\u00a0\ud83c\udf05</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore outside <strong>cozy</strong>\u00a0<strong>vistas</strong> and <strong>chat</strong> with the locals!<strong>\u00a0\ud83e\udd9d\ud83e\udd8a\ud83d\udc3c</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buon appetito!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429190?t=1773503838","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429190?t=1773503838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/2f821a90812eb22dd765d024026bad7f753288bd/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773503838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/2f821a90812eb22dd765d024026bad7f753288bd/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773503838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Support Pawsta \ud83d\udc2d on Kickstarter! \ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/d6700a6e399498a7be7db3bbcec48d94.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Pawsta</strong> \ud83d\udc2d is mostly being cooked up by a\u00a0<strong>small team</strong> of cozy chefs, who he wants to bring on to <strong>help</strong> out more!\u00a0\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <br> <br>To help <strong>achieve</strong> this, we've decided to run a <strong>Kickstarter</strong> <strong>campaign</strong> :)) Please consider checking it out &amp; pressing the  <strong>notify</strong> <strong>button</strong> to <strong>hear</strong> when it <strong>launches</strong>! \u2728 <br> <br>Thank you, lovely person reading this!\u00a0\ud83d\udc96</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pawsta</i></strong><i> is a <strong>cozy</strong> cooking game with cute <strong>claymation</strong>-style graphics. It stars <strong>Rigatoni</strong>, the mouse\ud83d\udc2d, as he travels the world <strong>mastering</strong> cuisines &amp; collecting <strong>mice-alin stars</strong>!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Make your <strong>Nonna </strong>proud by helping out your <strong>relatives </strong>at their <strong>international </strong>restaurants</i> \u2728 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook from Scratch!\ud83c\udf45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>to cook new cuisines<strong> from scratch</strong> by building them up <strong>step-by-step</strong>. <strong>Chop</strong> veggies, <strong>roll</strong> out dough, and <strong>sprinkle</strong> in fresh herbs until the food is<strong> just right</strong>!\u00a0\ud83e\udd0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta dough gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/1003de33ca7e7eecfc4f3a369ab04a40.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Cute Animal Guests!\ud83d\ude38</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders from a <strong>cute roster </strong>of <strong>animal </strong>patrons. Try to follow their orders as best as you can by choosing the correct food ingredients. Lots of\u00a0<strong>happy customers\u00a0</strong>can lead to great things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta kitty order gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a8bfd46ddf61595918aa2a4098aa540a.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Around the World!\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rigatoni has family all around the <strong>globe</strong>! Team up with your <strong>pilot</strong> friend,\u00a0<strong>Balto,\u00a0</strong>to travel the <strong>world </strong>and help out at their restaurants. It's <strong>your call </strong>where to go next, be it <strong>Brazil </strong>or <strong>Japan</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta plane flying gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/a35ce53894baaecb0e021203acfe9239.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master new cuisines!\u00a0\ud83c\udf63</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> and <strong>master</strong> new <strong>cuisines</strong> from the <strong>countries</strong> you visit, including <strong>sushi</strong> in Japan! <strong>Impress</strong> enough guests &amp; you'll also gain access to special\u00a0<strong>mice-alin</strong> dishes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.poster.avif?t=1773503838\" aria-label=\"Pawsta sushi cutting gif\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.webm?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/f071b79b8225a7a7908a6811189a16da.mp4?t=1773503838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meep!\ud83d\udc2d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let loose a bit by <strong>&quot